    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dd5b80d586269b7abc40430",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "三冠路线……那是一生只能参加一次的舞台。\n往“皋月赏”、“日本德比”与“菊花赏”\n一路迈进的路线。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3107b3d29a2e84217792d52c0e51fbaea3b67d23dbb50f44bc3f337e2e17268d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
